    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/5657c19bf40b6b0a82e9112b0e3d131b.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>\u201cTale of Jade / Li Guang\u201d , the first game we developed, has elements of Roguelite, strategy, and exploration.<br>The game is inspired by works such as &quot;Tsuro&quot;, &quot;Carcassonne&quot;, &quot;Night of Full Moon&quot; and &quot;Slay the Spire&quot;.<br>We are trying to create a new  card game with oriental elements of gameplay.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/75d52b030fe565777adf365ab1129c5e.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>The inspiration of the story &quot;Tale of Jade/ Li Guang&quot; came from the remains of the Yaoshan altar of the Liangzhu culture in China.<br>There are twelve tombs at the Yaoshan site, and based on this background, we created a story and name 12 ritual rooms by Twelve Branches,<br>The Twelve Branches are the traditional Chinese concept of timekeeping.<br>At the same time, in the traditional concept, the  Twelve Branches also related to the internal organs.<br>The two concepts corresponding to the Twelves Branches will influence the development of the plot in the game ......<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/486680088cc15f279a8f641bc6eead6e.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>Ramdom Map<br>Every time you enter the map, the game will generate the map randomly<br>In the map, every step you take, you have the chance to trigger a random event<br>I dont know whether this zone is difficult, i can only help you pray<br><br>Five Elements Circle<br>Each pair of adjacent five elements will trigger their own mutual reaction<br>And even the cards of single element can make combo too <br>It will be freer for building deck and be more fun for card playing<br><br><br>Beautiful Jade Fairy Support You<br>There are 4 jade fairy ( 4 girls) for you to pick in this version<br>Each fairy has her special skill<br>Based on the skill and build your deck , it may help make your battle easier<br><br><br>Funny Encounter(maybe)<br>You are likely to encounter a variety of random events that are nonsensical<br>Not all the monsters are vicious, they are as ordinary as us ...<br>How to deal with them? Follow your heart !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/8e82a1dab099a98e09c5e53864fe2a3d.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>Where is the GUIDE<br>If you are new to the game, you may still be unfamiliar with it<br>You can call out the GUIDE in the upper left corner of the question-mark button.<br><br>You Can Save!<br>The game now have no difficulty level.<br>For better experience to fresher, saving data is availiable<br><br><br><br>That's all. Wish you like our game !",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/5657c19bf40b6b0a82e9112b0e3d131b.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>\u201cTale of Jade / Li Guang\u201d , the first game we developed, has elements of Roguelite, strategy, and exploration.<br>The game is inspired by works such as &quot;Tsuro&quot;, &quot;Carcassonne&quot;, &quot;Night of Full Moon&quot; and &quot;Slay the Spire&quot;.<br>We are trying to create a new  card game with oriental elements of gameplay.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/75d52b030fe565777adf365ab1129c5e.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>The inspiration of the story &quot;Tale of Jade/ Li Guang&quot; came from the remains of the Yaoshan altar of the Liangzhu culture in China.<br>There are twelve tombs at the Yaoshan site, and based on this background, we created a story and name 12 ritual rooms by Twelve Branches,<br>The Twelve Branches are the traditional Chinese concept of timekeeping.<br>At the same time, in the traditional concept, the  Twelve Branches also related to the internal organs.<br>The two concepts corresponding to the Twelves Branches will influence the development of the plot in the game ......<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/486680088cc15f279a8f641bc6eead6e.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>Ramdom Map<br>Every time you enter the map, the game will generate the map randomly<br>In the map, every step you take, you have the chance to trigger a random event<br>I dont know whether this zone is difficult, i can only help you pray<br><br>Five Elements Circle<br>Each pair of adjacent five elements will trigger their own mutual reaction<br>And even the cards of single element can make combo too <br>It will be freer for building deck and be more fun for card playing<br><br><br>Beautiful Jade Fairy Support You<br>There are 4 jade fairy ( 4 girls) for you to pick in this version<br>Each fairy has her special skill<br>Based on the skill and build your deck , it may help make your battle easier<br><br><br>Funny Encounter(maybe)<br>You are likely to encounter a variety of random events that are nonsensical<br>Not all the monsters are vicious, they are as ordinary as us ...<br>How to deal with them? Follow your heart !<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537480/extras/8e82a1dab099a98e09c5e53864fe2a3d.avif?t=1733134360\" /></div><br>Where is the GUIDE<br>If you are new to the game, you may still be unfamiliar with it<br>You can call out the GUIDE in the upper left corner of the question-mark button.<br><br>You Can Save!<br>The game now have no difficulty level.<br>For better experience to fresher, saving data is availiable<br><br><br><br>That's all. Wish you like our game !",
    "short_description": "\u201cTale of Jade / Li Guang\u201d is a stand-alone roguelike card game with oriental elements.Constructing your own deck by 5 elements cards, Exploring the map, solving random encounters, beating the demon and uncovering the mystery of Li Guang\u2019s Kingdom.",
